        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Eric a very impressive tattoo artist, I am currently having him colour my tattoo drawn by another amazing artist, and the results are impeccable. He has blown my expectations out of the water. Sometimes having another artist finish a piece done by another exceptional artist can let down your expectations, but not with Eric. The investment he has put into his craft shows a million times over, the attention to detail is unmatched. I am so grateful to have him as my artist, on top of the results of his work this guy is the nicest and most empathetic, incredibly talented but so humble about himself.\nRecommend 10000/10!",
